From a8247e89837b63b0cbecbc9b39061342fe3689f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bugfix <bugfix@hayat.local>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:25:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix admin, public-site and notification bugs

- admin: unread-notification badge was reading .n from a Promise (always empty)
- admin: users forced to change a temporary password could not submit /profile/password
- admin: read-only article view no longer throws in the editor script; unchecked language boxes stay unchecked after a validation error
- admin: login 429 page now sets the login token cookie
- public: top-bar date was empty (fmtDate received an ISO string already ending in Z)
- public: category page 2 repeated the last article of page 1
- public: footer/home ad impressions no longer counted on POSTs, RSS or disabled sections
- public: sitemap.xml uses one query instead of one per article
- notifications: honour per-user permission overrides
- revisions: restoring a revision restores its tags
- media: HEIC/AVIF files are rejected instead of being stored as .mp4
- .npmrc: fix stale comment
---
 .npmrc                       |  2 +-
 public/js/admin.js           |  4 ++--
 src/lib/articles.js          |  3 +++
 src/lib/media.js             |  6 +++++-
 src/lib/notify.js            | 14 +++++++++-----
 src/lib/util.js              |  3 ++-
 src/routes/admin/articles.js |  2 +-
 src/routes/admin/index.js    |  8 ++++++--
 src/routes/public.js         | 20 ++++++++++++++------
 src/views/admin/kit.js       |  2 +-
 10 files changed, 44 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

